### The ethnic cleansing of Jerusalem

Jewish forces are ordered to

> Occupy the neighborhood and destroy all its houses.

On April 24, they attack the wealthy neighborhood of Sheikh Jarrah and blow up 20 homes before being stopped by British forces.

Late in April, the neighborhood of Qatamon falls. Itzhak Levy, the head of Haganah intelligence, reports:

> While the cleansing of Qatamon went on, pillage and robbery began. Soldiers and citizens took part in it. They broke into the houses and took from them furniture, clothing, electric equipment and food.